flowchart LR
  L[Local implementation] --> D[Demo / fixture]
  D --> E[Evidence-gated]
  E --> H[Human acceptance]
  H --> C[Customer pilot acceptance]
  C --> P[Production authorization]
  E -. missing evidence .-> HOLD[HOLD / no promotion]
  H -. failed review .-> HOLD
  P --> R[Observe / rollback / revoke]
  R --> HOLD
